    q("The office of an executive President elected by the people was created by the", ["1963 Constitution", "1979 Constitution", "1989 Constitution", "1999 Constitution"], 1, "The 1979 Constitution created the executive presidency, with the President both head of state and head of government. The 1963 President was ceremonial, and the 1999 Constitution restored the 1979 model."),
