    q("Which of the following is a feature of the 1999 Constitution?", ["A unicameral legislature", "A ceremonial President elected by the legislature", "A bicameral National Assembly and an executive President", "A one-party system"], 2, "It restored the 1979 model: a bicameral National Assembly, an executive President elected by the people, 36 states and the FCT, and 774 local government areas."),
